# Plan: GDPR Data Deletion (Keep Account)

## Feature Overview
Allow users to delete all their data while keeping their account active for future login.

## User Requirements
- Password confirmation required
- Stay logged in after deletion (show success message)
- Reset actionbar preferences to empty

## Data to Delete

| Table | Field | Cascade? |
|-------|-------|----------|
| tasks | user_id | Sessions auto-cascade |
| sessions | (via tasks) | Auto |
| projects | user_id | Yes |
| user_columns | user_id | Yes |
| refresh_tokens | user_id | Manual |
| password_reset_tokens | user_id | Manual |
| email_verification_tokens | user_id | Manual |
| invitations | invited_by_id | Manual |

**User record updates:** Reset `actionbar` to empty array, `last_login_at` to null

