## Frontend Implementation

### 1. API Method
**File:** `frontend/src/services/authApi.ts`

Add method:
```typescript
async deleteUserData(password: string): Promise<{ message: string }> {
  const res = await fetch(`${BASE_URL}/auth/data`, {
    method: 'DELETE',
    headers: mutationHeaders(),
    credentials: 'include',
    body: JSON.stringify({ password }),
  });
  if (!res.ok) {
    const data = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));
    throw new Error(data.error || 'Failed to delete user data');
  }
  return res.json();
}
```

